r Franklin County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, April to May hit 191% of normal on the middle, and July to August fell to 65%. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 50% and May to June at 152% on the middle.</p>"}
